ejáratot...",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"Itt van az ajtó, amit nem tudtunk",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"kinyitni...\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Ron",params:[6,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Mi ez a kis szerkezet mellette?\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[1,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Az időzár. Jól gondoltuk, hogy",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"nem azonnal nyílik ki az ajtó...\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Ron",params:[6,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"De mért védi időzár egyáltalán?",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"Mi van az ajtó mögött?\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[1,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Fogalmam sincs...\"",params:[]),(code:11510,indent:0,string:"(OFF)",params:[0,0,100,50]),(code:11550,indent:0,string:"Shuriken",params:[90,50,50]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[4,8,0,0,34,6,67,104,97,114,97,51,2,13,26,36,2,2,37,27]),(code:11410,indent:0,string:"",params:[3]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[10001,8,0,0,15,28,28,26,24,0,2,25,27,29,29]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[10005,8,0,0,15,28,28,26,24,0,2,25,27,29,29]),(code:11410,indent:0,string:"",params:[3]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Chara2",params:[2,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Lance",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"... Ne mozduljatok...\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Ron",params:[5,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Lance! Te meg... Mit keresel",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"itt?...\"",params:[]),(code:10660,indent:0,string:"Boss",params:[0,0,90,100,50]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Chara2",params:[2,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Lance",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Ehh... Nincs értelme tovább",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"tagadnod, hogy te vagy a császár...\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Ron",params:[5,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Mi??? Én??? Dehogy...\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Chara2",params:[2,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Lance",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Védd magad!\"",params:[]),(code:10330,indent:0,string:"",params:[0,0,8]),(code:10710,indent:0,string:"Draco2",params:[0,28,1,0,0,0]),(code:10660,indent:0,string:"Battle",params:[0,0,90,100,50]),(code:10330,indent:0,string:"",params:[0,0,6]),(code:10490,indent:0,string:"",params:[0,0]),(code:10330,indent:0,string:"",params:[1,0,6]),(code:10330,indent:0,string:"",params:[1,0,8]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Chara2",params:[2,0,0]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[4,8,0,0,28,26,24,0,2,25,27,29]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[10001,8,0,0,28,28,26,24,0,2,25,27,29,29]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Lance",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Mi???\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[1,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Van egy elméletem, ami szinte",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"már hihetetlen, de mégis nagyon",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"sok jel arra utal, hogy igaz...\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Ron",params:[6,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"???\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[1,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Menjünk a többiekhez, ezt",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"nekik is hallaniuk kéne...\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Chara2",params:[2,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Lance",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Hé, ez csak valami trükk,",params:[]),(code:2